answers.approach:
No shared goal exists —
so start by banning the worst;
silence is the gain.

Don’t crown one grand optimizer to govern every stream;
First log each touch and outcome in a shared, uncertain dream.

Start with fatigue and conflict rules, then shadow what we’d send;
Use holdouts and delayed rewards to learn where journeys bend.

Let margin, service, value, and consent share one refrain;
Make owners name the trade-offs—no model removes that pain.

Grant control one channel slowly, with rollback close at night;
Yet budgets, gaps, and missing state still blur the guiding light.
